{"title":"我会副会长单位——广东建工监理党总支书记、董事长黄伟中带队赴佛山区域调研指导","date":"2024-11-15","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:17.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">我会副会长单位&mdash;&mdash;广东建工监理党总支书记、董事长黄伟中带队赴佛山区域调研指导<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">11</span><span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>日，广东建工监理公司党总支书记、董事长黄伟中带队前往佛山区域下属合资公司<span lang=\"EN-US\">&mdash;&mdash;</span>广东佛高工程咨询有限公司（以下简称<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>佛高咨询公司<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>）开展实地调研与工作指导，公司党总支委员、副总经理（主持经营班子工作）汪高文陪同调研。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202411/2A.png\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">调研组在认真听取合资公司有关年度生产经营状况及未来工作规划汇报后，与合资股东单位进行深入的探讨交流。黄伟中对佛高咨询公司自开业以来所取得的业绩提升与进步给予了充分肯定，并针对合资公司的未来发展提出了四点指导性的意见：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">一是高度重视人才培养，全力提升员工整体素质和履约能力；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">二是强化安全风险与隐患排查双重预防机制，切实保障公司稳定；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">三是落实集团和公司要求，做好应对环境变化策略，奋力完成全年生产经营指标；<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">四是积极寻求新增长点，不断拓宽业务范围和业务领域。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202411/2B.jpg\" style=\"width: 1280px; height: 960px;\" /></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">随后，调研组实地考察了佛山分公司创智湾花园全过程技术咨询项目，详细了解该项目施工进度及团队运作情况，在听取项目负责人工作汇报后，强调项目部要着力增强项目管理能力，优化分配各类资源，有效控制风险，从而顺利达成目标，此外，要明确定位，精心做好<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>建工监理<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>品牌，为后续拓展经营奠定坚实基础。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:30.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:15.0pt;\r\nline-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">此次调研指导，既充分彰显了公司对下属合资公司的高度战略重视，也体现了公司领导对项目部的深切关怀，通过实地考察与深入交流，为佛高咨询公司的发展明确了方向，也为公司的整体战略实施注入了崭新活力。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:15.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei Light&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>"}